, battle head-to-head across multiple battlefields and game modes. With an ever-expanding roster of champions, frequent updates and a thriving tournament scene, League of Legends offers endless replayability for players of every skill level.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/league-of-legends", "videos": [{"id": 35582, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "IzMnCv_lPxI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IzMnCv_lPxI", "title": "Welcome to League of Legends | Official Cinematic", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IzMnCv_lPxI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 35584, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "BGtROJeMPeE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BGtROJeMPeE", "title": "What is League of Legends?", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BGtROJeMPeE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 86450, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "vzHrjOMfHPY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vzHrjOMfHPY", "title": "A New Dawn | Cinematic - League of Legends", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vzHrjOMfHPY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 86451, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "aR-KAldshAE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aR-KAldshAE", "title": "Warriors | Season 2020 Cinematic - League of Legends (ft. 2WEI and Edda Hayes)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aR-KAldshAE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 86452, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "zF5Ddo9JdpY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zF5Ddo9JdpY", "title": "Awaken | Season 2019 Cinematic - League of Legends (ft. Valerie Broussard)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zF5Ddo9JdpY/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 5956, "name": "League of Legends"}]}